  "description": "Multiple wide slow solitons overlapping — the memory of waves rather than the waves themselves. Moderate dissipation means each soliton is fading, but slowly enough that many coexist. LFO1 slow AM. The ripples on a pond after the stone has long since reached the bottom. Organic because the decay is honest and unhurried.",
